Subject: [PATCH] Separate browser saved files and disposable recovery

Keep saved files independent of recovery. Acknowledge named Open Main File
and common document-close Discard before continuing. Pause and finish autosave
while deleting, retain the snapshot and cancel closing when persistence fails.
Desktop cleanup retains its existing behavior and reports success.
Upstream issue searches for browser discard persistence found no matching issue.

